{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_014CYPcxDmZmxZBKSoZ7ZgNh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\n2\t# AMP\n3\t\n4\t  C implementation of the uber simple [AMP](https://github.com/visionmedia/node-amp) protocol.\n5\t\n6\t## Example\n7\t\n8\t```c\n9\tchar *args[] = { \"some\", \"stuff\", \"here\" };\n10\t\n11\t// encode\n12\tchar *buf = amp_encode(args, 3);\n13\t\n14\t// decode header\n15\tamp_t msg = {0};\n16\tamp_decode(&msg, buf);\n17\tassert(1 == msg.version);\n18\tassert(3 == msg.argc);\n19\t\n20\t// decode args\n21\tfor (int i = 0; i < msg.argc; ++i) {\n22\t  char *arg = amp_decode_arg(&msg);\n23\t  printf(\"%d : %s\\n\", i, arg);\n24\t}\n25\t```\n26\t\n27\t## Implementations\n28\t\n29\t - c: this library (~10m ops/s)\n30\t - [node](https://github.com/visionmedia/node-amp) ~(1.5m ops/s)\n31\t\n32\t# License\n33\t\n34\t  MIT"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36d75b9b-0a0e-4026-97c8-5a00543f9daa","uuid":"6da31604-b8c7-45a8-a0a1-943a642d01dc","timestamp":"2026-05-30T06:48:45.034Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/harvest-crust-jFTDsk/project/c_src/Readme.md","content":"\n# AMP\n\n  C implementation of the uber simple [AMP](https://github.com/visionmedia/node-amp) protocol.\n\n## Example\n\n```c\nchar *args[] = { \"some\", \"stuff\", \"here\" };\n\n// encode\nchar *buf = amp_encode(args, 3);\n\n// decode header\namp_t msg = {0};\namp_decode(&msg, buf);\nassert(1 == msg.version);\nassert(3 == msg.argc);\n\n// decode args\nfor (int i = 0; i < msg.argc; ++i) {\n  char *arg = amp_decode_arg(&msg);\n  printf(\"%d : %s\\n\", i, arg);\n}\n```\n\n## Implementations\n\n - c: this library (~10m ops/s)\n - [node](https://github.com/visionmedia/node-amp) ~(1.5m ops/s)\n\n# License\n\n  MIT","numLines":34,"startLine":1,"totalLines":34}}}
